  "priorExpiration": "2012-03-15",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 514.02 Number of Plates.\n\n(a) The department shall issue 2 registration plates except for the following:\n\n(1) Trailer plates;\n\n(2) Dealer plates, all classes;\n\n(3) Motorcycle plates;\n\n(4) Moped plates;\n\n(5) Motor carrier plates;\n\n(6) Temporary plates;\n\n(7) Tractor plates;\n\n(8) Street rod plates; and\n\n(9) Construction equipment plates.\n\nSource. #7972, eff 10-17-03 (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 500); ss by #9995, INTERIM, eff 9-17-11, EXPIRED: 3-15-12\n\nNew. #10135, eff 5-23-12; ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 515.02)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c500.html"
